//github.com/gausszhou/litegraph/blob/master/packages/nodes-events/src/EventCounter.ts" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">EventCounter.ts</a></li></ul><h2 id="events-delay" tabindex="-1"><code>events/delay</code> — Delay <a class="header-anchor" href="#events-delay" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;`events/delay` — Delay {#events-delay}&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Delays one event</p><ul><li>输入：<code>event: action</code></li><li>输出：<code>on_time: event</code></li><li>属性：<code>timeInMs</code></li><li>源码：<a href="https://github.com/gausszhou/litegraph/blob/master/packages/nodes-events/src/EventDelay.ts" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">EventDelay.ts</a></li></ul><h2 id="events-filter" tabindex="-1"><code>events/filter</code> — Filter Event <a class="header-anchor" href="#events-filter" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;`events/filter` — Filter Event {#events-filter}&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Blocks events that do not match the filter</p><ul><li>输入：<code>event: action</code>、<code>compare_value: *</code></li><li>输出：<code>accept: event</code>、<code>reject: event</code></li><li>控件：<code>Mode: combo</code>、<code>Prop.: text</code>、<code>Op.: combo</code>、<code>Value: text</code></li><li>属性：<code>compareValue</code>、<code>propertyName</code>、<code>mode</code>、<code>operation</code></li><li>源码：<a href="https://github.com/gausszhou/litegraph/blob/master/packages/nodes-events/src/EventFilter.ts" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">EventFilter.ts</a></li></ul><h2 id="events-frame-delay" tabindex="-1"><code>events/frame_delay</code> — Frame Delay <a class="header-anchor" href="#events-frame-delay" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;`events/frame_delay` — Frame Delay {#events-frame-delay}&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Delays one event by frame count</p><ul><li>输入：<code>event: action</code></li><li>输出：<code>on_time: event</code></li><li>属性：<code>timeInFrames</code></li><li>源码：<a href="https://github.com/gausszhou/litegraph/blob/master/packages/nodes-events/src/EventFrameDelay.ts" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">EventFrameDelay.ts</a></li></ul><h2 id="events-log" tabindex="-1"><code>events/log</code> — Log Event <a class="header-anchor" href="#events-log" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;`events/log` — Log Event {#events-log}&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Log event in console</p><ul><li>输入：<code>event: action</code></li><li>输出：无</li><li>控件：<code>Action: text</code>、<code>Param: text</code>、<code>Opts: text</code></li><li>源码：<a href="https://github.com/gausszhou/litegraph/blob/master/packages/nodes-events/src/EventLog.ts" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">EventLog.ts</a></li></ul><h2 id="events-sequence" tabindex="-1"><code>events/sequence</code> — Sequence <a class="header-anchor" href="#events-sequence" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;`events/sequence` — Sequence {#events-sequence}&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Triggers a sequence of events when an event arrives</p><ul><li>输入：<code>—: action</code></li><li>输出：<code>—: event</code></li><li>源码：<a href="https://github.com/gausszhou/litegraph/blob/master/packages/nodes-events/src/Sequence.ts" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Sequence.ts</a></li></ul><h2 id="events-timer" tabindex="-1"><code>events/timer</code> — Timer <a class="header-anchor" href="#events-timer" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;`events/timer` — Timer {#events-timer}&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Sends an event every N milliseconds</p><ul><li>输入：无</li><li>输出：<code>on_tick: event</code></li><li>属性：<code>interval</code>、<code>event</code></li><li>源码：<a href="https://github.com/gausszhou/litegraph/blob/master/packages/nodes-events/src/TimerEvent.ts" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">TimerEvent.ts</a></li></ul><h2 id="events-trigger" tabindex="-1"><code>events/trigger</code> — Trigger Event <a class="header-anchor" href="#events-trigger" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;`events/trigger` — Trigger Event {#events-trigger}&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Triggers event if input evaluates to true</p><ul><li>输入：<code>if: any</code></li><li>输出：<code>true: event</code>、<code>change: event</code>、<code>false: event</code></li><li>属性：<code>onlyOnChange</code></li><li>源码：<a href="https://github.com/gausszhou/litegraph/blob/master/packages/nodes-events/src/TriggerEvent.ts" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">TriggerEvent.ts</a></li></ul><h2 id="events-wrap-as-event" tabindex="-1"><code>events/wrap_as_event</code> — Wrap As Event <a class="header-anchor" href="#events-wrap-as-event" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;`events/wrap_as_event` — Wrap As Event {#events-wrap-as-event}&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Triggers an event setting its parameter to the input value</p><ul><li>输入：<code>trigger: action</code>、<code>param: any</code></li><li>输出：<code>event: event</code></li><li>源码：<a href="https://github.com/gausszhou/litegraph/blob/master/packages/nodes-events/src/WrapAsEvent.ts" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">WrapAsEvent.ts</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const g=t(r,[["render",s]]);export{u as __pageData,g as default};
